WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.950
Pictures, diagrams and video still mean a different app for each.

2
00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:09.184
Your coding agent can't open any of them.
You: Make a short film of a tram riding to the moon.
Agent: I can write the script, but I can't draw or render it.

3
00:00:09.484 --> 00:00:13.184
Slopcamera
Give your coding agent a multimedia studio.

4
00:00:13.484 --> 00:00:18.434
Your agent makes them from source files it can revise.

5
00:00:18.734 --> 00:00:23.664
Then ask for a precise change.
You: Make the moon larger.
Agent: Done. The moon is larger, and the route, palette, score and timing stay the same.

6
00:00:23.964 --> 00:00:28.464
Every example on the site ships with its source.

7
00:00:28.764 --> 00:00:33.004
It runs on your computer, with no account.

8
00:00:33.354 --> 00:00:39.300
Ask your agent: “Install Slopcamera from slopcamera.com”
Free and open source · Latest release v3.10.3
slopcamera.com
